## 1.3. "Commercial Purpose"

"Commercial Purpose" means any purpose intended, directly or indirectly, to obtain or facilitate:

- revenue;
- profit;
- financial compensation;
- commercial advantage;
- business advantage;
- customer value;
- operational value;
- cost savings;
- economic benefit;
- or the provision of a commercial product or service.

An activity may constitute a Commercial Purpose even if the Software itself is provided free of charge.

The absence of a direct payment for the Software does not make an otherwise commercial use permitted.

