## 1.4. "Production Use"

"Production Use" means using the Software in an environment or system that performs actual operational, business, customer-facing, organizational, or service-providing functions.

Production Use includes, without limitation:

- operating a live application;
- operating a customer-facing application;
- operating an operational API;
- operating production infrastructure;
- operating internal business infrastructure;
- processing actual business operations;
- providing functionality to actual users;
- supporting a real organization or business;
- using the Software as part of a live service;
- using the Software for actual operational workloads.

