## 1.5. "Deployment"

"Deployment" means installing, configuring, hosting, operating, publishing, or otherwise placing the Software into an environment for actual operational use.

Temporary deployment performed solely for an Educational Purpose is not considered prohibited Deployment.

Examples of permitted temporary deployment include:

- laboratory deployment;
- classroom deployment;
- testing deployment;
- demonstration deployment;
- simulated production deployment;
- migration exercises;
- integration exercises;
- benchmarking environments;
- security exercises;
- failure-recovery exercises.

