## 1.6. "Service"

"Service" means any product, service, hosted application, SaaS, API, platform, consulting activity, managed service, support service, integration service, or other offering that uses, incorporates, depends upon, is derived from, or materially benefits from the Software.

A Service may be provided directly or indirectly.

